{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14301044","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14301044","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1430104401:1":{"text":"그야 자기들이 한 “선행” 때문이지.","source_cn":"还能是什么，自然是他们干的那些“好事”。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x768E57C13D874CFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1430104402:1":{"text":"하루 종일 죽상을 하고 레오프론에서 무슨 좋은 소식이 없을까 걱정하는 꼴이라니...","source_cn":"他们现在每天忧心忡忡，猜测耀光那边会传回怎样的消息……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF5E63E2D7277271","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1430104403:1":{"text":"아무리 나빠져 봤자 얼마나 더 나빠지겠어? 그럴 바에는 맛있는 거 먹으면서 기다리는 게 낫지!","source_cn":"要我说最坏能到哪里去？与其每天忧心，不如吃好喝好等通知！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CC41D7D928E9C08","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:矮人葛文娜":{"text":"드워프 그웨나","source":"矮人葛文娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}